{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_88028c10c2174c088b9d3599","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"0:1\" name=\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"4:2\" name=\"Start Here\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1400\" height=\"4794\">\n    <frame id=\"4:3\" name=\"Frame\" x=\"64\" y=\"64\" width=\"1272\" height=\"168\">\n      <text id=\"4:4\" name=\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"167\" height=\"17\" />\n      <text id=\"4:5\" name=\"Balance — personal finance app\" x=\"0\" y=\"29\" width=\"626\" height=\"58\" />\n      <text id=\"4:6\" name=\"Design the complete Balance mobile app: a personal finance app where Esaaa Warden signs up with a phone number, checks the balance, upcoming bills and transactions, manages cards and crypto assets, reads income analytics, follows a coin price, sends money to a contact and browses a community forum. Canvas 375 × 812, light mode only. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"99\" width=\"1272\" height=\"69\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:7\" name=\"Frame\" x=\"64\" y=\"288\" width=\"1272\" height=\"228\">\n      <text id=\"4:8\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"135\" height=\"32\" />\n      <text id=\"4:9\" name=\"1. Build exactly the 11 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand primary color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself (neutrals, text, surfaces, success / error / warning / disabled, chart colors), plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the main navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use logos, card artwork, flags and icons from 04 · Media. People have no photos: use Avatar_Neutral or initials. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\" x=\"0\" y=\"48\" width=\"1272\" height=\"180\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:10\" name=\"Frame\" x=\"64\" y=\"572\" width=\"1272\" height=\"1844\">\n      <text id=\"4:11\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"379\" height=\"32\" />\n      <text id=\"4:12\" name=\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\" x=\"0\" y=\"48\" width=\"1272\" height=\"20\" />\n      <frame id=\"4:13\" name=\"Frame\" x=\"0\" y=\"84\" width=\"1272\" height=\"1760\">\n        <frame id=\"4:14\" name=\"01_Sign_Up\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"408\" height=\"346\">\n          <text id=\"4:15\" name=\"01_Sign_Up\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"360\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:16\" name=\"Goal: Start registration with a phone number.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"360\" height=\"19\" />\n          <text id=\"4:17\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"89\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:18\" name=\"• Actions: Continue • Copy: “Sign up” · “Sign up with phone number” · “A code will be sent to your number” • Legal: “By signing up, you agree to the Terms of Service and Privacy Policy, including Cookie Use.” (Terms of Service and Privacy Policy are links) • Phone: country code +62 (Flag_Indonesia, changeable) · number 858 2409 3560\" x=\"24\" y=\"115\" width=\"360\" height=\"152\" />\n          <text id=\"4:19\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"277\" width=\"32\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:20\" name=\"→ Continue → 02_OTP\" x=\"24\" y=\"303\" width=\"360\" height=\"19\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:21\" name=\"02_OTP\" x=\"432\" y=\"0\" width=\"408\" height=\"289\">\n          <text id=\"4:22\" name=\"02_OTP\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"360\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:23\" name=\"Goal: Verify the phone number with a 4-digit code.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"360\" height=\"19\" />\n          <text id=\"4:24\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"89\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:25\" name=\"• Actions: back · Resend code · Continue • Code: 4 digits, none entered yet • Copy: “OTP” · “Enter code” • Legal: same text as 01_Sign_Up\" x=\"24\" y=\"115\" width=\"360\" height=\"76\" />\n          <text id=\"4:26\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"201\" width=\"32\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:27\" name=\"→ back → 01_Sign_Up → Continue → 03_Home_My_Balance\" x=\"24\" y=\"227\" width=\"360\" height=\"38\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:28\" name=\"03_Home_My_Balance\" x=\"864\" y=\"0\" width=\"408\" height=\"555\">\n          <text id=\"4:29\" name=\"03_Home_My_Balance\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"360\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:30\" name=\"Goal: See the total balance at a glance and start money actions.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"360\" height=\"38\" />\n          <text id=\"4:31\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"108\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:32\" name=\"• Account: avatar · “Hi, Esaaa!” · messages entry · notifications entry • Actions: Send · Receive · Add • Balance: “Your Balance” $190,008.03 · +8% · currency USD (Flag_USA, changeable) • Main navigation: current tab Home • Spending: “Financial health” · “Latest 7 days” · daily spend Mon–Sun with values on a 10K–50K scale · entry to details • Transfer list: “Transfer list” · add contact · 5 contacts • View: switch between My Balance / Upcoming Bills / Transactions · current: My Balance\" x=\"24\" y=\"134\" width=\"360\" height=\"228\" />\n          <text id=\"4:33\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"372\" width=\"32\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:34\" name=\"→ Upcoming Bills → 04_Home_Upcoming_Bills → Transactions → 05_Home_Transactions → Send → 11_Send → contact Bessie Cooper → 11_Send → Financial health details → 09_Analytics → messages entry → 06_Discussion_Forum → tabs → 03 / 09 / 07 / 08\" x=\"24\" y=\"398\" width=\"360\" height=\"133\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:35\" name=\"04_Home_Upcoming_Bills\" x=\"0\" y=\"579\" width=\"408\" height=\"365\">\n          <text id=\"4:36\" name=\"04_Home_Upcoming_Bills\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"360\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:37\" name=\"Goal: Review upcoming subscription bills and pay one.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"360\" height=\"19\" />\n          <text id=\"4:38\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"89\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:39\" name=\"• Account: same as 03 • Bill actions: Add · Edit · Delete • Bills: “Upcoming Bills” · 3 bills, soonest due first, each with logo, name, amount, due date, cycle, category and Pay now • Main navigation: current tab Home • View: same switch as 03 · current: Upcoming Bills\" x=\"24\" y=\"115\" width=\"360\" height=\"133\" />\n          <text id=\"4:40\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"258\" width=\"32\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:41\" name=\"→ My Balance → 03 → Transactions → 05 → tabs\" x=\"24\" y=\"284\" width=\"360\" height=\"57\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:42\" name=\"05_Home_Transactions\" x=\"432\" y=\"579\" width=\"408\" height=\"346\">\n          <text id=\"4:43\" name=\"05_Home_Transactions\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"360\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:44\" name=\"Goal: Scan recent money movement.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"360\" height=\"19\" />\n          <text id=\"4:45\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"89\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:46\" name=\"• Account: same as 03 • Main navigation: current tab Home • Transactions: “Transactions” · 6 transactions, newest first, each with logo, type, date and signed amount (+ money in, − money out) • View: same switch as 03 · current: Transactions\" x=\"24\" y=\"115\" width=\"360\" height=\"114\" />\n          <text id=\"4:47\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"239\" width=\"32\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:48\" name=\"→ My Balance → 03 → Upcoming Bills → 04 → tabs\" x=\"24\" y=\"265\" width=\"360\" height=\"57\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:49\" name=\"06_Discussion_Forum\" x=\"864\" y=\"579\" width=\"408\" height=\"346\">\n          <text id=\"4:50\" name=\"06_Discussion_Forum\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"360\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:51\" name=\"Goal: Browse community finance discussions.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"360\" height=\"19\" />\n          <text id=\"4:52\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"89\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:53\" name=\"• Actions: back · messages entry · notifications entry • Copy: “Discussion Forum” • Posts: 2 posts, each with avatar, name, verified badge, topic, date and time, body, comment / like / dislike counts and a more menu · the user has liked Devon Lane’s post • Search &amp; filter: search “Search...” · Filter • Topics: Personal Finance / Investments / Cryptocurrencies · current: Personal Finance\" x=\"24\" y=\"115\" width=\"360\" height=\"152\" />\n          <text id=\"4:54\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"277\" width=\"32\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:55\" name=\"→ back → 03_Home_My_Balance\" x=\"24\" y=\"303\" width=\"360\" height=\"19\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:56\" name=\"07_Cards\" x=\"0\" y=\"968\" width=\"408\" height=\"384\">\n          <text id=\"4:57\" name=\"07_Cards\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"360\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:58\" name=\"Goal: See the primary card and crypto assets.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"360\" height=\"19\" />\n          <text id=\"4:59\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"89\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:60\" name=\"• Actions: back · avatar · more menu · Add Card • Assets: “Assets” · Solana / Bitcoin / Ethereum with ticker and value • Card: primary card (Card_Art_Green, Esaaa Warden, **** **** **** 3447, Exp 09/24) • Copy: “Cards” • Main navigation: current tab Cards • Transactions: latest 3\" x=\"24\" y=\"115\" width=\"360\" height=\"152\" />\n          <text id=\"4:61\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"277\" width=\"32\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:62\" name=\"→ back → 03 → Bitcoin → 10_Markets → tabs\" x=\"24\" y=\"303\" width=\"360\" height=\"57\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:63\" name=\"08_Profile\" x=\"432\" y=\"968\" width=\"408\" height=\"365\">\n          <text id=\"4:64\" name=\"08_Profile\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"360\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:65\" name=\"Goal: See account identity, all cards and recent activity.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"360\" height=\"19\" />\n          <text id=\"4:66\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"89\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:67\" name=\"• Account: Esaaa Warden · avatar · primary card number · edit profile entry • Actions: back · messages entry · notifications entry · more menu • Cards: “Your Cards” · all 3 cards • Copy: “Profile” • Main navigation: current tab Profile • Transactions: “Transactions” · See all · latest 3\" x=\"24\" y=\"115\" width=\"360\" height=\"152\" />\n          <text id=\"4:68\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"277\" width=\"32\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:69\" name=\"→ See all → 05_Home_Transactions → tabs\" x=\"24\" y=\"303\" width=\"360\" height=\"38\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:70\" name=\"09_Analytics\" x=\"864\" y=\"968\" width=\"408\" height=\"422\">\n          <text id=\"4:71\" name=\"09_Analytics\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"360\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:72\" name=\"Goal: Understand income vs expenses and where income comes from.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"360\" height=\"38\" />\n          <text id=\"4:73\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"108\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:74\" name=\"• Actions: back · avatar · more menu • Copy: “Analytics” • Income breakdown chart: Sales $15,190.00 · 52% / Investment $11,451.03 · 39% / Other $2,590.00 · 9% · headline share “52%” • Main navigation: current tab Analytics • Period: “Monthly” (changeable) • Totals: Total income $29,231.03 · Total expenses $1,999.00 • View: Income / Expenses · current: Income\" x=\"24\" y=\"134\" width=\"360\" height=\"190\" />\n          <text id=\"4:75\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"334\" width=\"32\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:76\" name=\"→ back → 03 → tabs\" x=\"24\" y=\"360\" width=\"360\" height=\"38\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:77\" name=\"10_Markets\" x=\"0\" y=\"1414\" width=\"408\" height=\"346\">\n          <text id=\"4:78\" name=\"10_Markets\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"360\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:79\" name=\"Goal: Check a coin&#39;s price and trade it.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"360\" height=\"19\" />\n          <text id=\"4:80\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"89\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:81\" name=\"• Actions: back · avatar · Sell · Buy • Coin: “Bitcoin” with logo (changeable) • Copy: “Markets” • History: “History” · See all · Solana / Bitcoin / Ethereum • Price: “Current price” $1,954.00 (+3.85%) • Price chart: candlesticks · price scale $1,000–$5,000 · times 08:00–24:00 • Range: 1H 2H 8H 1D 1W 1M 1Y · current: 1D\" x=\"24\" y=\"115\" width=\"360\" height=\"152\" />\n          <text id=\"4:82\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"277\" width=\"32\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:83\" name=\"→ back → 07_Cards\" x=\"24\" y=\"303\" width=\"360\" height=\"19\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:84\" name=\"11_Send\" x=\"432\" y=\"1414\" width=\"408\" height=\"327\">\n          <text id=\"4:85\" name=\"11_Send\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"360\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:86\" name=\"Goal: Send money to a contact.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"360\" height=\"19\" />\n          <text id=\"4:87\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"89\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:88\" name=\"• Actions: back · avatar · Send • Amount: $500.00 • Copy: “Send” • Number pad: 1–9, “.”, 0, backspace • Recipient: Bessie Cooper · avatar · card **** **** **** 8820 · option to change recipient\" x=\"24\" y=\"115\" width=\"360\" height=\"114\" />\n          <text id=\"4:89\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"239\" width=\"32\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:90\" name=\"→ back → 03 → Send → 03_Home_My_Balance\" x=\"24\" y=\"265\" width=\"360\" height=\"38\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:91\" name=\"Frame\" x=\"64\" y=\"2472\" width=\"1272\" height=\"188\">\n      <text id=\"4:92\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"222\" height=\"32\" />\n      <text id=\"4:93\" name=\"• Onboarding: 01_Sign_Up → 02_OTP → 03_Home_My_Balance. • Home has three views of one screen, switched in place: My Balance (03), Upcoming Bills (04), Transactions (05). All three share the same account area (avatar, greeting, messages, notifications). • Main navigation on 03, 04, 05, 07, 08, 09 — four tabs in this order: Home (Icon_Home) → 03 · Analytics (Icon_Analytics) → 09 · Cards (Icon_Cards) → 07 · Profile (Icon_Profile) → 08. The current tab must match the frame. How it looks is yours. • Pushed screens with back: 02, 06, 07, 08, 09, 10, 11. 06, 10 and 11 have no main navigation. • There is no Receive, notifications or payment-success screen — do not add frames beyond the 11.\" x=\"0\" y=\"48\" width=\"1272\" height=\"140\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:94\" name=\"Frame\" x=\"64\" y=\"2716\" width=\"1272\" height=\"1389\">\n      <text id=\"4:95\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"190\" height=\"32\" />\n      <text id=\"4:96\" name=\"Use these values verbatim. Amounts: “+” = money in, “-” = money out.\" x=\"0\" y=\"48\" width=\"1272\" height=\"20\" />\n      <frame id=\"4:97\" name=\"Frame\" x=\"0\" y=\"84\" width=\"1272\" height=\"1305\">\n        <frame id=\"4:98\" name=\"User &amp; balance\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"624\" height=\"150\">\n          <text id=\"4:99\" name=\"User &amp; balance\" x=\"25\" y=\"21\" width=\"109\" height=\"22\" />\n          <text id=\"4:100\" name=\"Esaaa Warden · greeting “Hi, Esaaa!” · avatar = Avatar_Neutral Phone: +62 (Indonesia) 858 2409 3560 Today: Aug 20, 2023 · currency USD “Your Balance” $190,008.03 · +8% · currency selector USD (Flag_USA)\" x=\"25\" y=\"53\" width=\"576\" height=\"76\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:101\" name=\"Transfer list\" x=\"648\" y=\"0\" width=\"624\" height=\"93\">\n          <text id=\"4:102\" name=\"Transfer list\" x=\"25\" y=\"21\" width=\"87\" height=\"22\" />\n          <text id=\"4:103\" name=\"Add contact, then: Bessie Cooper, Devon Lane, Eleanor Pena, Jenny Wilson, Cody Fisher\" x=\"25\" y=\"53\" width=\"576\" height=\"19\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:104\" name=\"Financial health\" x=\"0\" y=\"174\" width=\"624\" height=\"112\">\n          <text id=\"4:105\" name=\"Financial health\" x=\"25\" y=\"21\" width=\"115\" height=\"22\" />\n          <text id=\"4:106\" name=\"“Latest 7 days” · spend per day · axis 10K–50K Mon 24K · Tue 35K · Wed 45K · Thu 22K · Fri 34K · Sat 18K · Sun 30K\" x=\"25\" y=\"53\" width=\"576\" height=\"38\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:107\" name=\"Upcoming bills (soonest first)\" x=\"648\" y=\"174\" width=\"624\" height=\"150\">\n          <text id=\"4:108\" name=\"Upcoming bills (soonest first)\" x=\"25\" y=\"21\" width=\"215\" height=\"22\" />\n          <text id=\"4:109\" name=\"Line Messenger (Logo_Line) · $21.00 · due Sep 05, 2023 · 1 month · Subscriptions · Pay now Adobe XD (Logo_Adobe_XD) · $126.02 · due Sep 19, 2023 · 1 month · Subscriptions · Pay now Netflix (Logo_Netflix) · $932.53 · due Jul 08, 2024 · 1 year · Subscriptions · Pay now Bill actions: Add · Edit · Delete\" x=\"25\" y=\"53\" width=\"576\" height=\"76\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:110\" name=\"Transactions (newest first)\" x=\"0\" y=\"348\" width=\"624\" height=\"207\">\n          <text id=\"4:111\" name=\"Transactions (newest first)\" x=\"25\" y=\"21\" width=\"197\" height=\"22\" />\n          <text id=\"4:112\" name=\"Aug 19, 2023 · PayPal (Logo_PayPal) · Transferred · -$123.00 Jul 20, 2023 · DANA (Logo_DANA) · Transferred · -$12.00 May 08, 2023 · Google Play (Logo_Google_Play) · Refund · +$234.00 Feb 28, 2023 · Shopee (Logo_Shopee) · Refund · +$15.00 Jan 25, 2023 · Apple (Logo_Apple) · Payment · -$92.00 Jan 16, 2023 · Spotify (Logo_Spotify) · Payment · -$20.00 Show latest 3 where a screen asks for “latest 3”.\" x=\"25\" y=\"53\" width=\"576\" height=\"133\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:113\" name=\"Cards\" x=\"648\" y=\"348\" width=\"624\" height=\"131\">\n          <text id=\"4:114\" name=\"Cards\" x=\"25\" y=\"21\" width=\"44\" height=\"22\" />\n          <text id=\"4:115\" name=\"Card_Art_Green · Esaaa Warden · **** **** **** 3447 · Exp 09/24 · primary Card_Art_Pink · Esaaa Warden · **** **** **** 8821 · Exp 03/26 Card_Art_Purple · Esaaa Warden · **** **** **** 5104 · Exp 11/25\" x=\"25\" y=\"53\" width=\"576\" height=\"57\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:116\" name=\"Assets\" x=\"0\" y=\"579\" width=\"624\" height=\"131\">\n          <text id=\"4:117\" name=\"Assets\" x=\"25\" y=\"21\" width=\"50\" height=\"22\" />\n          <text id=\"4:118\" name=\"Solana · SOL · $12,094.08 (Crypto_Solana) Bitcoin · BTC · $17,238.11 (Crypto_Bitcoin) Ethereum · ETH · $8,200.00 (Crypto_Ethereum)\" x=\"25\" y=\"53\" width=\"576\" height=\"57\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:119\" name=\"Analytics\" x=\"648\" y=\"579\" width=\"624\" height=\"188\">\n          <text id=\"4:120\" name=\"Analytics\" x=\"25\" y=\"21\" width=\"68\" height=\"22\" />\n          <text id=\"4:121\" name=\"Total income $29,231.03 · Total expenses $1,999.00 Switch: Income (selected) / Expenses · Period: Monthly Sales $15,190.00 · 52% Investment $11,451.03 · 39% Other $2,590.00 · 9% Headline share: 52% (Sales)\" x=\"25\" y=\"53\" width=\"576\" height=\"114\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:122\" name=\"Markets\" x=\"0\" y=\"791\" width=\"624\" height=\"150\">\n          <text id=\"4:123\" name=\"Markets\" x=\"25\" y=\"21\" width=\"60\" height=\"22\" />\n          <text id=\"4:124\" name=\"Bitcoin · “Current price” $1,954.00 (+3.85%) Ranges 1H 2H 8H 1D 1W 1M 1Y · selected 1D Candlestick · y $1,000–$5,000 · x 08:00 10:00 12:00 15:00 18:00 21:00 24:00 “History” + See all: Solana, Bitcoin, Ethereum · actions Sell / Buy\" x=\"25\" y=\"53\" width=\"576\" height=\"76\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:125\" name=\"Send\" x=\"648\" y=\"791\" width=\"624\" height=\"112\">\n          <text id=\"4:126\" name=\"Send\" x=\"25\" y=\"21\" width=\"38\" height=\"22\" />\n          <text id=\"4:127\" name=\"Recipient Bessie Cooper · **** **** **** 8820 · amount $500.00 Keypad 1–9, “.”, 0, backspace · button “Send”\" x=\"25\" y=\"53\" width=\"576\" height=\"38\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:128\" name=\"Discussion forum\" x=\"0\" y=\"965\" width=\"624\" height=\"340\">\n          <text id=\"4:129\" name=\"Discussion forum\" x=\"25\" y=\"21\" width=\"127\" height=\"22\" />\n          <text id=\"4:130\" name=\"Search placeholder “Search...” · Filter Topics: Personal Finance (selected) / Investments / Cryptocurrencies Devon Lane (verified) · Personal finance · Jan 18, 2023 · 11:00 AM · liked “FindBuddy is a comprehensive personal finance app that allows you to track and manage your spending, create budgets, and set financial goals. It also provides a visual representation of your financial health.” 12 Comments · 160 Likes · 0 Dislikes Eleanor Pena (verified) · Personal finance · Jan 18, 2023 · 11:00 AM “Personal Capital is not only a budgeting tool but also an investment tracker. It provides a holistic view of your financial situation by combining budgeting and investment tracking features.” 12 Comments · 160 Likes · 0 Dislikes\" x=\"25\" y=\"53\" width=\"576\" height=\"266\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:131\" name=\"Sign up &amp; OTP\" x=\"648\" y=\"965\" width=\"624\" height=\"150\">\n          <text id=\"4:132\" name=\"Sign up &amp; OTP\" x=\"25\" y=\"21\" width=\"103\" height=\"22\" />\n          <text id=\"4:133\" name=\"Sign up: “Sign up with phone number” · helper “A code will be sent to your number” · Continue Legal: “By signing up, you agree to the Terms of Service and Privacy Policy, including Cookie Use.” (Terms of Service, Privacy Policy as links) OTP: “Enter code” · 4 digits · “Resend code” · Continue\" x=\"25\" y=\"53\" width=\"576\" height=\"76\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:134\" name=\"Frame\" x=\"64\" y=\"4161\" width=\"1272\" height=\"253\">\n      <text id=\"4:135\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"301\" height=\"32\" />\n      <frame id=\"4:136\" name=\"Frame\" x=\"0\" y=\"48\" width=\"1272\" height=\"205\">\n        <frame id=\"4:137\" name=\"Frame\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"624\" height=\"205\">\n          <text id=\"4:138\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"24\" y=\"20\" width=\"95\" height=\"22\" />\n          <text id=\"4:139\" name=\"• Frame list and exact names • Must-include content per frame (what, not how) • Navigation structure and links • All data and copy • Brand primary color + Plus Jakarta Sans • Media: logos, card artwork, flags, icons, neutral avatar • Default Button, default Text Field, platform shell\" x=\"24\" y=\"52\" width=\"576\" height=\"133\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:140\" name=\"Frame\" x=\"648\" y=\"0\" width=\"624\" height=\"186\">\n          <text id=\"4:141\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"24\" y=\"20\" width=\"182\" height=\"22\" />\n          <text id=\"4:142\" name=\"• Layout, grouping, order and emphasis on every screen • All other colors: neutrals, text, surfaces, semantic and chart colors • Type scale, spacing, radii, elevation • All states: selected, pressed, disabled, error, liked, destructive • Headers, main navigation and all business components • Chart styling (bars, breakdown, candlesticks)\" x=\"24\" y=\"52\" width=\"576\" height=\"114\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:143\" name=\"Frame\" x=\"64\" y=\"4470\" width=\"1272\" height=\"260\">\n      <text id=\"4:144\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"203\" height=\"32\" />\n      <text id=\"4:145\" name=\"Your file is compared with the brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"48\" width=\"1272\" height=\"20\" />\n      <text id=\"4:146\" name=\"1. Checklist coverage per frame 2. Data &amp; copy accuracy 3. Flow &amp; prototype completeness 4. Information hierarchy 5. Visual quality &amp; consistency of your own system 6. Component reuse 7. State design (selected tabs and switches, liked post, empty code inputs, signed amounts)\" x=\"0\" y=\"84\" width=\"1272\" height=\"140\" />\n      <text id=\"4:147\" name=\"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 11 named frames, your components and the prototype.\" x=\"0\" y=\"240\" width=\"1272\" height=\"20\" />\n    </frame>\n  </frame>\n</canvas>"},{"type":"text","text":"IMPORTANT: After you call this tool, you MUST call get_design_context if trying to implement the design, since this tool only returns metadata. If you do not call get_design_context, the agent will not be able to implement the design."}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ffb9fb83-96a2-4fc1-a77d-9e3578a63389","uuid":"e7731cb9-b8cf-424d-a0de-f008e79141aa","timestamp":"2026-10-28T18:57:48.931Z","tool_use_result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"0:1\" name=\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"4:2\" name=\"Start Here\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1400\" height=\"4794\">\n    <frame id=\"4:3\" name=\"Frame\" x=\"64\" y=\"64\" width=\"1272\" height=\"168\">\n      <text id=\"4:4\" name=\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"167\" height=\"17\" />\n      <text id=\"4:5\" name=\"Balance — personal finance app\" x=\"0\" y=\"29\" width=\"626\" height=\"58\" />\n      <text id=\"4:6\" name=\"Design the complete Balance mobile app: a personal finance app where Esaaa Warden signs up with a phone number, checks the balance, upcoming bills and transactions, manages cards and crypto assets, reads income analytics, follows a coin price, sends money to a contact and browses a community forum. Canvas 375 × 812, light mode only. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"99\" width=\"1272\" height=\"69\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:7\" name=\"Frame\" x=\"64\" y=\"288\" width=\"1272\" height=\"228\">\n      <text id=\"4:8\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"135\" height=\"32\" />\n      <text id=\"4:9\" name=\"1. Build exactly the 11 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand primary color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself (neutrals, text, surfaces, success / error / warning / disabled, chart colors), plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the main navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use logos, card artwork, flags and icons from 04 · Media. People have no photos: use Avatar_Neutral or initials. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\" x=\"0\" y=\"48\" width=\"1272\" height=\"180\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:10\" name=\"Frame\" x=\"64\" y=\"572\" width=\"1272\" height=\"1844\">\n      <text id=\"4:11\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"379\" height=\"32\" />\n      <text id=\"4:12\" name=\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\" x=\"0\" y=\"48\" width=\"1272\" height=\"20\" />\n      <frame id=\"4:13\" name=\"Frame\" x=\"0\" y=\"84\" width=\"1272\" height=\"1760\">\n        <frame id=\"4:14\" name=\"01_Sign_Up\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"408\" height=\"346\">\n          <text id=\"4:15\" name=\"01_Sign_Up\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"360\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:16\" name=\"Goal: Start registration with a phone number.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"360\" height=\"19\" />\n          <text id=\"4:17\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"89\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:18\" name=\"• Actions: Continue • Copy: “Sign up” · “Sign up with phone number” · “A code will be sent to your number” • Legal: “By signing up, you agree to the Terms of Service and Privacy Policy, including Cookie Use.” (Terms of Service and Privacy Policy are links) • Phone: country code +62 (Flag_Indonesia, changeable) · number 858 2409 3560\" x=\"24\" y=\"115\" width=\"360\" height=\"152\" />\n          <text id=\"4:19\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"277\" width=\"32\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:20\" name=\"→ Continue → 02_OTP\" x=\"24\" y=\"303\" width=\"360\" height=\"19\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:21\" name=\"02_OTP\" x=\"432\" y=\"0\" width=\"408\" height=\"289\">\n          <text id=\"4:22\" name=\"02_OTP\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"360\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:23\" name=\"Goal: Verify the phone number with a 4-digit code.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"360\" height=\"19\" />\n          <text id=\"4:24\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"89\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:25\" name=\"• Actions: back · Resend code · Continue • Code: 4 digits, none entered yet • Copy: “OTP” · “Enter code” • Legal: same text as 01_Sign_Up\" x=\"24\" y=\"115\" width=\"360\" height=\"76\" />\n          <text id=\"4:26\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"201\" width=\"32\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:27\" name=\"→ back → 01_Sign_Up → Continue → 03_Home_My_Balance\" x=\"24\" y=\"227\" width=\"360\" height=\"38\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:28\" name=\"03_Home_My_Balance\" x=\"864\" y=\"0\" width=\"408\" height=\"555\">\n          <text id=\"4:29\" name=\"03_Home_My_Balance\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"360\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:30\" name=\"Goal: See the total balance at a glance and start money actions.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"360\" height=\"38\" />\n          <text id=\"4:31\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"108\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:32\" name=\"• Account: avatar · “Hi, Esaaa!” · messages entry · notifications entry • Actions: Send · Receive · Add • Balance: “Your Balance” $190,008.03 · +8% · currency USD (Flag_USA, changeable) • Main navigation: current tab Home • Spending: “Financial health” · “Latest 7 days” · daily spend Mon–Sun with values on a 10K–50K scale · entry to details • Transfer list: “Transfer list” · add contact · 5 contacts • View: switch between My Balance / Upcoming Bills / Transactions · current: My Balance\" x=\"24\" y=\"134\" width=\"360\" height=\"228\" />\n          <text id=\"4:33\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"372\" width=\"32\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:34\" name=\"→ Upcoming Bills → 04_Home_Upcoming_Bills → Transactions → 05_Home_Transactions → Send → 11_Send → contact Bessie Cooper → 11_Send → Financial health details → 09_Analytics → messages entry → 06_Discussion_Forum → tabs → 03 / 09 / 07 / 08\" x=\"24\" y=\"398\" width=\"360\" height=\"133\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:35\" name=\"04_Home_Upcoming_Bills\" x=\"0\" y=\"579\" width=\"408\" height=\"365\">\n          <text id=\"4:36\" name=\"04_Home_Upcoming_Bills\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"360\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:37\" name=\"Goal: Review upcoming subscription bills and pay one.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"360\" height=\"19\" />\n          <text id=\"4:38\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"89\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:39\" name=\"• Account: same as 03 • Bill actions: Add · Edit · Delete • Bills: “Upcoming Bills” · 3 bills, soonest due first, each with logo, name, amount, due date, cycle, category and Pay now • Main navigation: current tab Home • View: same switch as 03 · current: Upcoming Bills\" x=\"24\" y=\"115\" width=\"360\" height=\"133\" />\n          <text id=\"4:40\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"258\" width=\"32\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:41\" name=\"→ My Balance → 03 → Transactions → 05 → tabs\" x=\"24\" y=\"284\" width=\"360\" height=\"57\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:42\" name=\"05_Home_Transactions\" x=\"432\" y=\"579\" width=\"408\" height=\"346\">\n          <text id=\"4:43\" name=\"05_Home_Transactions\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"360\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:44\" name=\"Goal: Scan recent money movement.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"360\" height=\"19\" />\n          <text id=\"4:45\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"89\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:46\" name=\"• Account: same as 03 • Main navigation: current tab Home • Transactions: “Transactions” · 6 transactions, newest first, each with logo, type, date and signed amount (+ money in, − money out) • View: same switch as 03 · current: Transactions\" x=\"24\" y=\"115\" width=\"360\" height=\"114\" />\n          <text id=\"4:47\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"239\" width=\"32\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:48\" name=\"→ My Balance → 03 → Upcoming Bills → 04 → tabs\" x=\"24\" y=\"265\" width=\"360\" height=\"57\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:49\" name=\"06_Discussion_Forum\" x=\"864\" y=\"579\" width=\"408\" height=\"346\">\n          <text id=\"4:50\" name=\"06_Discussion_Forum\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"360\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:51\" name=\"Goal: Browse community finance discussions.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"360\" height=\"19\" />\n          <text id=\"4:52\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"89\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:53\" name=\"• Actions: back · messages entry · notifications entry • Copy: “Discussion Forum” • Posts: 2 posts, each with avatar, name, verified badge, topic, date and time, body, comment / like / dislike counts and a more menu · the user has liked Devon Lane’s post • Search &amp; filter: search “Search...” · Filter • Topics: Personal Finance / Investments / Cryptocurrencies · current: Personal Finance\" x=\"24\" y=\"115\" width=\"360\" height=\"152\" />\n          <text id=\"4:54\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"277\" width=\"32\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:55\" name=\"→ back → 03_Home_My_Balance\" x=\"24\" y=\"303\" width=\"360\" height=\"19\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:56\" name=\"07_Cards\" x=\"0\" y=\"968\" width=\"408\" height=\"384\">\n          <text id=\"4:57\" name=\"07_Cards\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"360\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:58\" name=\"Goal: See the primary card and crypto assets.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"360\" height=\"19\" />\n          <text id=\"4:59\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"89\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:60\" name=\"• Actions: back · avatar · more menu · Add Card • Assets: “Assets” · Solana / Bitcoin / Ethereum with ticker and value • Card: primary card (Card_Art_Green, Esaaa Warden, **** **** **** 3447, Exp 09/24) • Copy: “Cards” • Main navigation: current tab Cards • Transactions: latest 3\" x=\"24\" y=\"115\" width=\"360\" height=\"152\" />\n          <text id=\"4:61\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"277\" width=\"32\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:62\" name=\"→ back → 03 → Bitcoin → 10_Markets → tabs\" x=\"24\" y=\"303\" width=\"360\" height=\"57\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:63\" name=\"08_Profile\" x=\"432\" y=\"968\" width=\"408\" height=\"365\">\n          <text id=\"4:64\" name=\"08_Profile\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"360\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:65\" name=\"Goal: See account identity, all cards and recent activity.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"360\" height=\"19\" />\n          <text id=\"4:66\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"89\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:67\" name=\"• Account: Esaaa Warden · avatar · primary card number · edit profile entry • Actions: back · messages entry · notifications entry · more menu • Cards: “Your Cards” · all 3 cards • Copy: “Profile” • Main navigation: current tab Profile • Transactions: “Transactions” · See all · latest 3\" x=\"24\" y=\"115\" width=\"360\" height=\"152\" />\n          <text id=\"4:68\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"277\" width=\"32\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:69\" name=\"→ See all → 05_Home_Transactions → tabs\" x=\"24\" y=\"303\" width=\"360\" height=\"38\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:70\" name=\"09_Analytics\" x=\"864\" y=\"968\" width=\"408\" height=\"422\">\n          <text id=\"4:71\" name=\"09_Analytics\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"360\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:72\" name=\"Goal: Understand income vs expenses and where income comes from.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"360\" height=\"38\" />\n          <text id=\"4:73\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"108\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:74\" name=\"• Actions: back · avatar · more menu • Copy: “Analytics” • Income breakdown chart: Sales $15,190.00 · 52% / Investment $11,451.03 · 39% / Other $2,590.00 · 9% · headline share “52%” • Main navigation: current tab Analytics • Period: “Monthly” (changeable) • Totals: Total income $29,231.03 · Total expenses $1,999.00 • View: Income / Expenses · current: Income\" x=\"24\" y=\"134\" width=\"360\" height=\"190\" />\n          <text id=\"4:75\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"334\" width=\"32\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:76\" name=\"→ back → 03 → tabs\" x=\"24\" y=\"360\" width=\"360\" height=\"38\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:77\" name=\"10_Markets\" x=\"0\" y=\"1414\" width=\"408\" height=\"346\">\n          <text id=\"4:78\" name=\"10_Markets\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"360\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:79\" name=\"Goal: Check a coin&#39;s price and trade it.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"360\" height=\"19\" />\n          <text id=\"4:80\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"89\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:81\" name=\"• Actions: back · avatar · Sell · Buy • Coin: “Bitcoin” with logo (changeable) • Copy: “Markets” • History: “History” · See all · Solana / Bitcoin / Ethereum • Price: “Current price” $1,954.00 (+3.85%) • Price chart: candlesticks · price scale $1,000–$5,000 · times 08:00–24:00 • Range: 1H 2H 8H 1D 1W 1M 1Y · current: 1D\" x=\"24\" y=\"115\" width=\"360\" height=\"152\" />\n          <text id=\"4:82\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"277\" width=\"32\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:83\" name=\"→ back → 07_Cards\" x=\"24\" y=\"303\" width=\"360\" height=\"19\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:84\" name=\"11_Send\" x=\"432\" y=\"1414\" width=\"408\" height=\"327\">\n          <text id=\"4:85\" name=\"11_Send\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"360\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:86\" name=\"Goal: Send money to a contact.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"360\" height=\"19\" />\n          <text id=\"4:87\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"89\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:88\" name=\"• Actions: back · avatar · Send • Amount: $500.00 • Copy: “Send” • Number pad: 1–9, “.”, 0, backspace • Recipient: Bessie Cooper · avatar · card **** **** **** 8820 · option to change recipient\" x=\"24\" y=\"115\" width=\"360\" height=\"114\" />\n          <text id=\"4:89\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"239\" width=\"32\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:90\" name=\"→ back → 03 → Send → 03_Home_My_Balance\" x=\"24\" y=\"265\" width=\"360\" height=\"38\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:91\" name=\"Frame\" x=\"64\" y=\"2472\" width=\"1272\" height=\"188\">\n      <text id=\"4:92\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"222\" height=\"32\" />\n      <text id=\"4:93\" name=\"• Onboarding: 01_Sign_Up → 02_OTP → 03_Home_My_Balance. • Home has three views of one screen, switched in place: My Balance (03), Upcoming Bills (04), Transactions (05). All three share the same account area (avatar, greeting, messages, notifications). • Main navigation on 03, 04, 05, 07, 08, 09 — four tabs in this order: Home (Icon_Home) → 03 · Analytics (Icon_Analytics) → 09 · Cards (Icon_Cards) → 07 · Profile (Icon_Profile) → 08. The current tab must match the frame. How it looks is yours. • Pushed screens with back: 02, 06, 07, 08, 09, 10, 11. 06, 10 and 11 have no main navigation. • There is no Receive, notifications or payment-success screen — do not add frames beyond the 11.\" x=\"0\" y=\"48\" width=\"1272\" height=\"140\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:94\" name=\"Frame\" x=\"64\" y=\"2716\" width=\"1272\" height=\"1389\">\n      <text id=\"4:95\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"190\" height=\"32\" />\n      <text id=\"4:96\" name=\"Use these values verbatim. Amounts: “+” = money in, “-” = money out.\" x=\"0\" y=\"48\" width=\"1272\" height=\"20\" />\n      <frame id=\"4:97\" name=\"Frame\" x=\"0\" y=\"84\" width=\"1272\" height=\"1305\">\n        <frame id=\"4:98\" name=\"User &amp; balance\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"624\" height=\"150\">\n          <text id=\"4:99\" name=\"User &amp; balance\" x=\"25\" y=\"21\" width=\"109\" height=\"22\" />\n          <text id=\"4:100\" name=\"Esaaa Warden · greeting “Hi, Esaaa!” · avatar = Avatar_Neutral Phone: +62 (Indonesia) 858 2409 3560 Today: Aug 20, 2023 · currency USD “Your Balance” $190,008.03 · +8% · currency selector USD (Flag_USA)\" x=\"25\" y=\"53\" width=\"576\" height=\"76\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:101\" name=\"Transfer list\" x=\"648\" y=\"0\" width=\"624\" height=\"93\">\n          <text id=\"4:102\" name=\"Transfer list\" x=\"25\" y=\"21\" width=\"87\" height=\"22\" />\n          <text id=\"4:103\" name=\"Add contact, then: Bessie Cooper, Devon Lane, Eleanor Pena, Jenny Wilson, Cody Fisher\" x=\"25\" y=\"53\" width=\"576\" height=\"19\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:104\" name=\"Financial health\" x=\"0\" y=\"174\" width=\"624\" height=\"112\">\n          <text id=\"4:105\" name=\"Financial health\" x=\"25\" y=\"21\" width=\"115\" height=\"22\" />\n          <text id=\"4:106\" name=\"“Latest 7 days” · spend per day · axis 10K–50K Mon 24K · Tue 35K · Wed 45K · Thu 22K · Fri 34K · Sat 18K · Sun 30K\" x=\"25\" y=\"53\" width=\"576\" height=\"38\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:107\" name=\"Upcoming bills (soonest first)\" x=\"648\" y=\"174\" width=\"624\" height=\"150\">\n          <text id=\"4:108\" name=\"Upcoming bills (soonest first)\" x=\"25\" y=\"21\" width=\"215\" height=\"22\" />\n          <text id=\"4:109\" name=\"Line Messenger (Logo_Line) · $21.00 · due Sep 05, 2023 · 1 month · Subscriptions · Pay now Adobe XD (Logo_Adobe_XD) · $126.02 · due Sep 19, 2023 · 1 month · Subscriptions · Pay now Netflix (Logo_Netflix) · $932.53 · due Jul 08, 2024 · 1 year · Subscriptions · Pay now Bill actions: Add · Edit · Delete\" x=\"25\" y=\"53\" width=\"576\" height=\"76\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:110\" name=\"Transactions (newest first)\" x=\"0\" y=\"348\" width=\"624\" height=\"207\">\n          <text id=\"4:111\" name=\"Transactions (newest first)\" x=\"25\" y=\"21\" width=\"197\" height=\"22\" />\n          <text id=\"4:112\" name=\"Aug 19, 2023 · PayPal (Logo_PayPal) · Transferred · -$123.00 Jul 20, 2023 · DANA (Logo_DANA) · Transferred · -$12.00 May 08, 2023 · Google Play (Logo_Google_Play) · Refund · +$234.00 Feb 28, 2023 · Shopee (Logo_Shopee) · Refund · +$15.00 Jan 25, 2023 · Apple (Logo_Apple) · Payment · -$92.00 Jan 16, 2023 · Spotify (Logo_Spotify) · Payment · -$20.00 Show latest 3 where a screen asks for “latest 3”.\" x=\"25\" y=\"53\" width=\"576\" height=\"133\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:113\" name=\"Cards\" x=\"648\" y=\"348\" width=\"624\" height=\"131\">\n          <text id=\"4:114\" name=\"Cards\" x=\"25\" y=\"21\" width=\"44\" height=\"22\" />\n          <text id=\"4:115\" name=\"Card_Art_Green · Esaaa Warden · **** **** **** 3447 · Exp 09/24 · primary Card_Art_Pink · Esaaa Warden · **** **** **** 8821 · Exp 03/26 Card_Art_Purple · Esaaa Warden · **** **** **** 5104 · Exp 11/25\" x=\"25\" y=\"53\" width=\"576\" height=\"57\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:116\" name=\"Assets\" x=\"0\" y=\"579\" width=\"624\" height=\"131\">\n          <text id=\"4:117\" name=\"Assets\" x=\"25\" y=\"21\" width=\"50\" height=\"22\" />\n          <text id=\"4:118\" name=\"Solana · SOL · $12,094.08 (Crypto_Solana) Bitcoin · BTC · $17,238.11 (Crypto_Bitcoin) Ethereum · ETH · $8,200.00 (Crypto_Ethereum)\" x=\"25\" y=\"53\" width=\"576\" height=\"57\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:119\" name=\"Analytics\" x=\"648\" y=\"579\" width=\"624\" height=\"188\">\n          <text id=\"4:120\" name=\"Analytics\" x=\"25\" y=\"21\" width=\"68\" height=\"22\" />\n          <text id=\"4:121\" name=\"Total income $29,231.03 · Total expenses $1,999.00 Switch: Income (selected) / Expenses · Period: Monthly Sales $15,190.00 · 52% Investment $11,451.03 · 39% Other $2,590.00 · 9% Headline share: 52% (Sales)\" x=\"25\" y=\"53\" width=\"576\" height=\"114\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:122\" name=\"Markets\" x=\"0\" y=\"791\" width=\"624\" height=\"150\">\n          <text id=\"4:123\" name=\"Markets\" x=\"25\" y=\"21\" width=\"60\" height=\"22\" />\n          <text id=\"4:124\" name=\"Bitcoin · “Current price” $1,954.00 (+3.85%) Ranges 1H 2H 8H 1D 1W 1M 1Y · selected 1D Candlestick · y $1,000–$5,000 · x 08:00 10:00 12:00 15:00 18:00 21:00 24:00 “History” + See all: Solana, Bitcoin, Ethereum · actions Sell / Buy\" x=\"25\" y=\"53\" width=\"576\" height=\"76\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:125\" name=\"Send\" x=\"648\" y=\"791\" width=\"624\" height=\"112\">\n          <text id=\"4:126\" name=\"Send\" x=\"25\" y=\"21\" width=\"38\" height=\"22\" />\n          <text id=\"4:127\" name=\"Recipient Bessie Cooper · **** **** **** 8820 · amount $500.00 Keypad 1–9, “.”, 0, backspace · button “Send”\" x=\"25\" y=\"53\" width=\"576\" height=\"38\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:128\" name=\"Discussion forum\" x=\"0\" y=\"965\" width=\"624\" height=\"340\">\n          <text id=\"4:129\" name=\"Discussion forum\" x=\"25\" y=\"21\" width=\"127\" height=\"22\" />\n          <text id=\"4:130\" name=\"Search placeholder “Search...” · Filter Topics: Personal Finance (selected) / Investments / Cryptocurrencies Devon Lane (verified) · Personal finance · Jan 18, 2023 · 11:00 AM · liked “FindBuddy is a comprehensive personal finance app that allows you to track and manage your spending, create budgets, and set financial goals. It also provides a visual representation of your financial health.” 12 Comments · 160 Likes · 0 Dislikes Eleanor Pena (verified) · Personal finance · Jan 18, 2023 · 11:00 AM “Personal Capital is not only a budgeting tool but also an investment tracker. It provides a holistic view of your financial situation by combining budgeting and investment tracking features.” 12 Comments · 160 Likes · 0 Dislikes\" x=\"25\" y=\"53\" width=\"576\" height=\"266\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:131\" name=\"Sign up &amp; OTP\" x=\"648\" y=\"965\" width=\"624\" height=\"150\">\n          <text id=\"4:132\" name=\"Sign up &amp; OTP\" x=\"25\" y=\"21\" width=\"103\" height=\"22\" />\n          <text id=\"4:133\" name=\"Sign up: “Sign up with phone number” · helper “A code will be sent to your number” · Continue Legal: “By signing up, you agree to the Terms of Service and Privacy Policy, including Cookie Use.” (Terms of Service, Privacy Policy as links) OTP: “Enter code” · 4 digits · “Resend code” · Continue\" x=\"25\" y=\"53\" width=\"576\" height=\"76\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:134\" name=\"Frame\" x=\"64\" y=\"4161\" width=\"1272\" height=\"253\">\n      <text id=\"4:135\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"301\" height=\"32\" />\n      <frame id=\"4:136\" name=\"Frame\" x=\"0\" y=\"48\" width=\"1272\" height=\"205\">\n        <frame id=\"4:137\" name=\"Frame\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"624\" height=\"205\">\n          <text id=\"4:138\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"24\" y=\"20\" width=\"95\" height=\"22\" />\n          <text id=\"4:139\" name=\"• Frame list and exact names • Must-include content per frame (what, not how) • Navigation structure and links • All data and copy • Brand primary color + Plus Jakarta Sans • Media: logos, card artwork, flags, icons, neutral avatar • Default Button, default Text Field, platform shell\" x=\"24\" y=\"52\" width=\"576\" height=\"133\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:140\" name=\"Frame\" x=\"648\" y=\"0\" width=\"624\" height=\"186\">\n          <text id=\"4:141\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"24\" y=\"20\" width=\"182\" height=\"22\" />\n          <text id=\"4:142\" name=\"• Layout, grouping, order and emphasis on every screen • All other colors: neutrals, text, surfaces, semantic and chart colors • Type scale, spacing, radii, elevation • All states: selected, pressed, disabled, error, liked, destructive • Headers, main navigation and all business components • Chart styling (bars, breakdown, candlesticks)\" x=\"24\" y=\"52\" width=\"576\" height=\"114\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:143\" name=\"Frame\" x=\"64\" y=\"4470\" width=\"1272\" height=\"260\">\n      <text id=\"4:144\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"203\" height=\"32\" />\n      <text id=\"4:145\" name=\"Your file is compared with the brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"48\" width=\"1272\" height=\"20\" />\n      <text id=\"4:146\" name=\"1. Checklist coverage per frame 2. Data &amp; copy accuracy 3. Flow &amp; prototype completeness 4. Information hierarchy 5. Visual quality &amp; consistency of your own system 6. Component reuse 7. State design (selected tabs and switches, liked post, empty code inputs, signed amounts)\" x=\"0\" y=\"84\" width=\"1272\" height=\"140\" />\n      <text id=\"4:147\" name=\"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 11 named frames, your components and the prototype.\" x=\"0\" y=\"240\" width=\"1272\" height=\"20\" />\n    </frame>\n  </frame>\n</canvas>"},{"type":"text","text":"IMPORTANT: After you call this tool, you MUST call get_design_context if trying to implement the design, since this tool only returns metadata. If you do not call get_design_context, the agent will not be able to implement the design."}],"_